# Secrets. The upload keystore and key.properties are already covered by
# android/.gitignore; these are the ones that live outside android/.
#
# googleCredentials.json is the Firebase service-account private key used for
# FCM and Google Sign-In. It belongs only on the production server (installed
# there with 600 perms) and must never reach the repo — anyone holding it can
# send push as Silitibum and mint tokens for the project.
**/googleCredentials.json
shortzz_backend/.env
shortzz_backend/.env.*
!shortzz_backend/.env.example
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties

# Local build/CI scratch
shortzz_backend/storage/logs/*.log
